 expanded into luxury home decor retail. Personal styling services are available both in-store and online. The company serves retail clients in the luxury fashion and home decor sectors, including consumers seeking designer wear, accessories, jewellery, and home products, as well as the global Indian diaspora, tourists, and local consumers interested in Indian design. The company was incorporated in 2015 and is based in Mumbai, India.","employees":1266,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795210615},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795210615,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"PURPLE STYLE LABS\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Purple Style Labs Ltd. Share Price Today - Purple Style Labs Ltd. Stock Price Live NSE/BSE","s":"CNBC TV18","d":1795082340,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxQYkY5QVZrWE1WM1A2Z3I2UEl1NTBDMjBKUXdkY19ZdjVxWEgzckQyTmY3eVVoVTk3d1VnLVlUSlpOdjNZdXpmbUY2ajR2N3Q0OXFhLTdJcnJ4Q21TaWpjY3dnTnV5aExFcmtZYnI0UGFSUG9NMlZ4V3E0RlBfOWZXVWgtS1ZCakU?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"PURPLE STYLE LABS LIMITED Share Price - Live NSE: PERNIASPOP Stock Price & Chart","s":"Upstox","d":1794811257,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTE5TWDVyMTY0M3duMXFwbVJtTHdpdlNuN2J2MXRYb094R3hHNG9DYXVSc2ZPSWpaam5ScEZWdGZNckVuekQ5N0ZNelFEdHJzaE9hZzJCcTJZUFFLNnFsY1R0RlBQSUI4QnI4NFJBTXg3M2lPdw?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Purple Style Labs targets ₹2,100 crore GMV by FY30 amid EBITDA turnaround","s":"scanx.trade","d":1794480079,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxPby1QODd3Rm80cG81NU9kUlNnMVZNSnY1OHFfSldyMWxJSDdhcVE2M3JLdmEtMDFZU0poM3FCcVVTcjZJMDJFMXY0QzZ4RndJMmR2VVN6M3BDenc4a193WUtCZThRTEhhaFd5N0FmNElMcjZ3Qmd4MFpfcGEwX0k3VEI2dVJQZ1NHZmd5ZGdZVVgxM0oycm1DMTNMQlN3NTNUMTI5WENab0tWRm5mWFR2ZS1HWXR6YjM3cC1GdGluQ0poQQ?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Purple Style Labs Q2 results: Net loss narrows 12.9% to ₹68.3 crore, revenue rises 30.7%","s":"CNBC TV18","d":1793606400,"u":"https://news.goo